      "title": "SAMS Project Contribution \u2013 Account Management Module",
      "body": "## Contribution Overview\n\nThis contribution focuses on the Account Management module of the Student Attendance Management System (SAMS), which was my assigned area of responsibility within Group B.\n\nThe contribution brings the existing Account Management functionality into the group's submission repository, together with its supporting frontend, backend, database and testing files.\n\n### Account Management Components\n- User account management and password changes.\n- Administrator account management.\n- Password resets and account status management.\n- Session termination and authentication controls.\n- Supporting database migrations and account management tests.\n\n### Purpose\nTo ensure that the Account Management module and its supporting components are included in the group's consolidated SAMS project for review, testing and presentation.\n\nThis contribution forms part of Group B's collaborative development of the Student Attendance Management System.",
